<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">Colosianji</para>
  <para style="toc1">Epistola Cãtrã Colosianji</para>
  <para style="toc2">Colosianji</para>
  <para style="toc3">Col</para>
  <para style="mt1">Epistola Cãtrã Colosianji</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Pavlu, apostul al Hristolu Isus prit voljea al Dumnidzãu, sh-fratili Timoteu, <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />ma scriem a popului a Dumnidzãlui, a fratsilor sh-a surãrilor tu Colose cai suntu pistimenji la Hristolu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Har sh-pace s-avets di la Dumnidzãlu, Tatãl a nostru.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hãristisiri sh-Rugãciunji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Noi hãristisim Dumnidzãlu, Tatãl a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos, di cãti ori nã rugãm trã voi, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />cã avem avdzãtã trã pistea a voastrã tu Hristolu Isus sh-trã vrearea tsi avets trã tut populu a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Aestã pisti sh-aestã vreari li avets di la nãdia tsi vã ashteapti tu tseruri, trã cai avets avdzãtã ma nãinti tu predicarea a alihiljei la evanghelu. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Aestu evanghelu tsi agiumsi la voi sh-la tutã lumea ma adutsi carpo, ntrã voi, di dzua tsi avdzãtã sh-dealihea cunuscutã harul a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Evanghelu aestu voi lu nvitsat di la Epafrai, colucrutorlu a nostru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tu niscãnti manuscrisi easti scriatã “a vostru”.</char></note> vrut, cai easti huzmichear pistimen al Hristos trã voi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:23">Flm 23</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />cai nã aspusi ti vrearea a voastrã tu Duh.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Trã atsea sh-noi di dzua tsi nvitsãm aestã nu pãpsim s-nã rugãm trã voi sh-lji cãftãm a Dumnidzãlui s-vã mplineascã cu tut cunushtearea a vreariljei a lui prit tutã frunimeatsa sh-aduchearea tsi Duhlu nã da. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Ashãtsi voi va putets s-fãtsets unã banã ti hãiri trã Domnul, tra s-lji arsits tu itsido, aducãnda carpo tu cathi faptã bunã sh-crishtãnda tu cunushtearea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Voi va vã nvãrtushits cu fuchia tsi yini di la putearea mãrit a Dumnidzãlui, cu cathi arãvdari sh-cu harauã, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />hãristisinda Tatãl, cai vã featsi axii tsi sh-voi s-hits pãrtashi tu mushtinirea a popului a Dumnidzãlui tu lunjinã. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Elu nã scoasi di putearea a scutidlui sh-nã strãmutã tu amirãriljea a Hiljilui a lui vrut, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />tu cai avem arãscumpãrarea, tsi easti ljirtarea a amãrtiilor.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Ef 1:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omlu sh-Lucrul al Hristos</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Elu easti icoana a nividzutlui Dumnidzã, prot-amintat a tuti fãpturilor,<verse eid="COL 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />cã tu nãsu s-adrarã tuti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">atseali cai suntu tu tseruri sh-atseali di pri loc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">atseali vidzutili sh-atseali nividzutili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">thronurili, domnilji, printsipãtsili sh-autoritãtsili.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">Tuti suntu adrati prit nãsu sh-trã nãsu.<verse eid="COL 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Elu easti nãinti di tuti faptili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:17">sh-tuti sta deadun tu nãsu.<verse eid="COL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Elu easti caplu a truplui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:18">tsi va s-dzãc a bisearicãljei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:18">Elu easti apãrnjita sh-protlu-amintat dit mortsã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:18">tsi elu si s-fac protlu la tuti.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:22-23">Ef 1:22-23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Cã a Dumnidzãlui lj-arsi tsi tu Hiljilu a lui s-bãneadzã tutã mplinãtatea a Dumnidzãlui.<verse eid="COL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Sh-prit Hiljiu s-puitueascã tuti cu Dumnidzãlu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:20">atseali cai suntu pri loc sh-atseali cai suntu tu tser,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:20">fãcãnda pace prit sãndzili a lui virsat tu crutsi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:16">Ef 2:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nãetea al Pavlu trã Huzmitipsiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Sh-voi tsi unã oarã earat xenji trã Dumnidzãlu sh-dushmanji tu minti trã faptili a voastri arali, <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />tora elu vã puitui tu truplu a lui prit moartea, tra s-vã pãrãstãseascã sãmtsã, fãrã-cusuri sh-nivãrghits nãintea a lui. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Armãnets vãrtoshi tu pisti, thimiljeats sh-niminats tu nãdia al evanghelu. Atsel evanghelu tsi avdzãt easti predicat la tuti fãpturili sum tser. Sh-mini, Pavlu, escu huzmichearlu a lui.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Tora mini mi hãrsescu di munduirili a meali trã voi, sh-ma mplinescu tu truplu a meu atseali tsi lipsescu tu munduirili a Hristolui, trã truplu a lui, tsi va s-dzãcã bisearica. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Huzmichear a bisearicãljei mi feciu dupã arãdãpsirea tsi nji pistipsi Dumnidzãlu trã voi, dimãndãnda ntreg zborlu al Dumnidzãu, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />mistiryiul tsi s-tsãnu ascumtu tu secoli sh-la brãnili, ma tsi tora s-fãnirusi a popului al Domnu. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Dumnidzãlu vru s-vã facã cunuscutã cã cai easti ayishtearea a mãririljei aishtui mistiryiu ntrã pãngãnjlji, tsi easti Hristolu ntru voi, nãdia a mãririljei. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Aestu Hristos predicãm sh-noi, urnipsinda sh-nvitsãnda cathi om cu tutã frunimeatsa tra s-pãrãstãsim cathi om perfectu tu Hristos. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Trã atsea mini mi munduescu alumtãnda cu agiutarea a puteariljei a Hristolui cai lucreadzã tu mini cu fuchii.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Voi tra sã shtits alumta atsea marea trã voi sh-trã atselji di Laoditsea, sh-trã tuts atselji cai nu au vidzut fatsa a mea. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Nãetea a mea easti s-inimuseascã ininjli a lor shi s-bãneadzã units tu vreari, tsi elji s-aibã cathi ayishteari tu aduchirea ntreagã shi s-cunoascã mistiryiul al Dumnidzãu, tsi easti Hristolu, <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />iu suntu ascumti tuti ayishtearili a frunimeatsiljei sh-a cunushteariljei.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Aestã vã u dzãc tsi vãrã s-nu vã arãdã cu zboari umflati.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:18">Rom 16:18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Sh-cãtse cu trup nu escu atsia la voi, tu duh escu cu voi sh-mi hãrsescu cãndu vã ved voi arãdãpsits sh-pistea a voastrã easti nvãrtushit tu Hristolu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">1Cor 5:3.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Trã atsea, ashãtsi di cum lu aprucheat Hristolu Isus ca Domnu, ashãtsi imnats tu nãsu, <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />la nãsu s-hits arãdãtsinats sh-pri nãsu thimiljeatsã bana a voastrã. Fãtsets-vã ma vãrtoshi tu pisti, ashãtsi cum vã au nvitsat sh-umplets-vã tu hãristisiri.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:20">Ef 2:20</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 2:22">22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Bãgats mintea tra s-nu vã fac vãrã sclayi prit filosofii arãdioasi sh-goali, dupã adetea a oaminjlor, dupã fuchiili sufliteascã a lumiljei aishtei sh-nu dupã Hristolu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:18">Rom 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:6">Ef 5:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Cã tu Hristolu, tutã mplinãtatea a Dumnidzãlui bãneadzã tu trup. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Voi hits fapts mplinji tu Hristos, cai easti caplu pristi itsi printsipatã sh-itsi autoritati.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:21-22">Ef 1:21-22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Units tu Hristolu, voi vã anvãrliga-tãljeat cu anvãrliga-tãljearea tsi nu s-featsi cu mãna a oaminjlor, ma cu anvãrliga-tãljearea faptã di Hristolu, tsi easti dizvishtearea di amãrtiili a truplui. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Voi vã ngrupat cu Hristolu prit pitedzlu, ma sh-vã nyeat deadun cu nãsu prit pisti la fuchia a Dumnidzãlui cai lu nyie Hristolu dit mortsã. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Rom 6:4</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Voi earats mortsã tu amãrtiili a voastri sh-tu nianvãrliga-tãljearea a truplui a vostru, ma Dumnidzãlu vã deadi banã cu nãsu sh-vã ljirtã tuti amãrtiili.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-5">Ef 2:1-5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Elu u ashtearsi documentul a dimãndãciunilor cai eara contra noi sh-nã condamna. Elu lu mutã sh-lu ncurfusi pri crutsi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:14-15">Ef 2:14-15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Ashãtsi Dumnidzãlu li dizviscu printsipãtsili sh-autoritãtsili dracuiti, sh-li arushinã nãintea a lumiljei, triumfãnda pristi atseali tu crutsi.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Trã atsea vãrã s-nu vã giudicã trã mãcari icã trã beari, trã sãrbãtoari, icã trã Lunã noauã sh-trã dzãlili di Sãmbãtã.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:1-12">Rom 14:1-12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Aesti suntu aumbra atsilor tsi au trã viniri, ma tsi dealihea easti Hristolu. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Nu alãsats vãrã s-vã arãcheascã premiul shi s-tradzi ca mari trã itia a viziunilor tsi ari vidzut icã ipiminiseashti tu tãpinii di nafoarã sh-alãvdãri di anghilji. Aestu om s-alavdã di vãnat dupã mintea a lui umineascã. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Atsel om nu easti ligat cu caplu, tsi easti Hristolu, di la cai s-hrãneashti tut truplu shi s-tsãni ligat deadun cu noduri sh-cu ligãturi, sh-creashti cu crishtearea al Dumnidzãu.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Macã murit deadun cu Hristolu di fuchiili sufliteascã a lumiljei, cãtse bãnats canda hits a lumiljei sh-vã sumbãgats a ordinilor a ljei, ca: <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Nu ljea! Nu gusteadzã! Nu ahulea!” <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Atseali tuti suntu lucri cai s-aspargã di ufilisirea, dupã dimãndãciunjili sh-nvitsãturili a oaminjlor. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Aesti au unã pãreari di frunimeatsã, cã s-nveascã cu ncljinari arãdioasã, cu tãpinii sh-cu ninjiluirea a truplui, ma dealihea nu au axii, ma suntu mash trã haraua a truplui.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Urnimii trã Sãmtsãri sh-trã Vrearea Frãtseascã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Trã atsea, macã vã nyeat cu Hristolu, cãftats atseali di nsus, iu Hristolu easti apunat tu nandreapta a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Minduits trã atseali di nsus, nu trã atseali di pri loc, <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />cã avets murit sh-bana a voastrã easti ascumtã deadun cu Hristolu tu Dumnidzã. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Cãndu va s-aspunã Hristolu, cai easti bana voastrã, atumtsea va vã aspunets sh-voi tu mãriri deadun cu nãsu. <verse eid="COL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Trã atsea fãtsets s-moarã orixili a voastri pri loc: curvãriljea, disfrãnarea, orixili atseali arali, chehili atseali arali sh-tãmãchearlãchili, cai easti idulatria. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Trã tuti aesti yini inatea a Dumnidzãlui pristi hiljilji a niascultariljei. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Tu aestã cali avets imnat sh-voi, cãndu bãnat tu eali. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Ma tora, arucats hima sh-voi tuti aesti: nãrirea, inatea, arãutatea, ngiurarea shi zboarili atseali lãvoasi dit gura a voastrã. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Nu arãdets un-alantu, cã voi lu dizviscut omlu atsel vecljiul deadun cu faptili a lui, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />sh-nviscut omlu atsel noulu tsi easti rinoit tu cunushtearea dupã icoana atsilui cai lu adrã. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Trã atsea nu ari ma Elinji sh-Iudei, anvãrliga-tãljeari sh-nianvãrliga-tãljeari, barbari shi Schithi, sclayi sh-liberi, ma itsido sh-tu iutsido easti Hristolu.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Nvishtets-vã ca aleptsã a Dumnidzãlui, sãmtsã sh-vruts cu njila a dorlui, cu bunãtati, cu tãpinii, cu frunimeatsã sh-cu arãvdari. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Arãvdats-lu sh-ljirtats-lu un-alantu, macã un ari vãrã tsiva contra a vãrui, ashãtsi di cum Domnul vã ari ljirtatã, ashãtsi fãtsets sh-voi. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Pristi tuti aesti, nvishtets vrearea, tsi easti ligãtura a perfectsionariljei! <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Pacea a Hristolui trã cai voi fut acljimat tu un singur trup, s-domneascã tu ininjli a voastri shi s-hits hãristisitori. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Zborlu a Hristolui s-bãneadzã tu voi cu bulãchi, cu cathi frunimeatsã nvitsãnda sh-urnipsinda un-alantu cu psalnji, imnuri sh-cãntitsi duhuroasi, sh-cãntãnda al Dumnidzãu cu har tu ininjili a voastri. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Itsido tsi fãtsets, cu zbor icã cu fapti, fãtsets-li tu numa a Domnului Isus, hãristisinda prit nãsu Dumnidzãlu Tatãl.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dimãndãciunji trã Casã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Voi muljeri, s-hits sumbãgati a bãrbatslor a voshtri, ashãtsi cum vã ari hari tu Domnul. <verse eid="COL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Voi bãrbatsi, s-li vrets muljerili a voastri sh-nu vã fãtsets amãroshi cu nãsi. <verse eid="COL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Voi cilimenji ascultats pãrintsãlji a voshtri tu tuti, cã aestã easti arsitã di Domnul. <verse eid="COL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Voi pãrintsã, nu lã nãrãits cilimenjlji a voshtri, tra s-nu chearã curaiulu. <verse eid="COL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Voi sclayi, ascultats tu itsido nicuchirlji a voshtri tu trup, huzmitipsinda nu mash nãintea a ocljilor a lor tra s-lã arsits a lor, ma cu tãpinia a inimãljei, avãnda fricã di Domnul. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Itsido tsi fãtsets, s-u fãtsets cu tutã inimã ca trã Domnul, nu ca trã oaminjlji, <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />shtinda cã di la Domnul va loats arãsplata a mushtiniriljei. Huzmitipsits-lji a Domnului Hristos. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Iarã atsel tsi fatsi nindriptati va ljea plata trã tuti nindriptatili tsi ari faptã. Dumnidzãlu nu tsãni cu hãtãri.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Domnji, dats-lã a huzmichearilor atsea tsi easti ndreptu sh-lã hãrzãeashti, shtinda cã sh-voi avets un Domnu tu tseruri.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alti Urnimii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Ipiminisits tu rugãciuni, stãnda dishtiptat tu ea cu hãristisiri. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Rugats-vã tutashã sh-trã noi, tsi Dumnidzãlu s-nã discljidã a noauã usha trã zborlu, trã dimãndari mistiryiul a Hristolui, trã cai sh-mini escu tu prãnghi. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Rugats-vã tra s-lu fac cunuscut, shi s-lu ghinihãbãrsescu ashãtsi cum prindi. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Imnats cu frunimeatsã nãintea atsilor di nafoarã, ufilisinda chirolu. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Zborlu a vostru s-hibã totãna cu har, uidisit cu sari, tra sã shtits cum prindi s-lji apãndisits a cathiunui.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pitritsearea al Tihicu sh-al Onesimu, Salutãri sh-Ghinicuvintãri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tihicul fratili a nostru vrut, huzmichear pistimen, sh-agiutorlu a meu tu Domnul, va s-vã aspunã itsido trã mini. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Mini lu pitricui la voi tamam trã aestã, tra s-cunoascã catandisea a noastrã shi s-inimuseascã ininjli a voastri. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Mini lu pitricui deadun cu Onesimul, fratili a nostru pistimen sh-vrut, tsi easti un di voi. Elji va s-vã spunã tuti cãti au undzitã aoa. <verse eid="COL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Aristarcul, hãpsãnitlu tsi easti deadun cu mini vã pitreatsi sãnãtati sh-Marcu cusurinlu al Barnaba (trã cai avets loat urnimii s-lu ghini-ashtiptats, ma s-yinã la voi). <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Vã pitreatsi sãnãtati sh-Isusul acljimat Iustu. Aeshti tsi suntu di anvãrliga-tãljearea suntu singuri tsi lucreadzã cu mini trã amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu, cai s-featsirã trã mini diznjirdari. <verse eid="COL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Vã pitreatsi sãnãtati Epafrai tsi easti di-a vostru sh-huzmichear al Hristos Isus. Elu alumtã totãna trã voi tu rugãciunji, tra s-armãnets perfectsã shi s-hits didip siguripsits tu voljea al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Mini mãrtirsescu trã nãsu, cã elu ari mari zel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lucreadzã multu</char></note> trã voi, trã atselji di Laoditsea sh-trã atselji di Hierapoli. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Vã pitreatsi sãnãtati Luca doctorul vrut sh-Dema. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Dats-lã sãnãtati la fratslji tu Laoditsea, la Nimfa sh-la bisearica tsi easti la casa a ljei. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Cãndu s-u cãntats aestã epistolã la voi, pitritsets-u trã cãntari sh-atsilor tu Laoditsea. Tutashã sh-voi, loats-u sh-cãntats-u atsea tsi am pitricut tu Laoditsea. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Dzãtsets-lji al Arhipu: “Bagã mintea la huzmitipsirea tsi loash tu Domnul, s-u mplineshti atsea.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Ncljinãciunea easti scriatã di mãna a mea, Pavlu. Adutsets a minti prãnghili a meali. Harul s-hibã cu voi!<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>